Fix: Always add any new node_modules dependency that ships untranspiled ESM/TS (such as @contentstack/live-preview-utils and its transitive lodash-es) to the transformIgnorePatterns workaround in jest.config.js by extending the negative lookahead, e.g. change nextJestConfig.transformIgnorePatterns[0] = "/node_modules/(?!swiper|@azure|uuid|jose|@panva).+\\.js$" to "/node_modules/(?!swiper|@azure|uuid|jose|@panva|@contentstack|lodash-es).+\\.js$", and run npm run test after adding such an import.
